 "insight": [
  "Imports of computers in Luxembourg decreased significantly from 2005 to 2025.",
  "The value of imports was 2.38 billion euros in 2005 and dropped to 335.5 million euros in 2025.",
  "The highest import value was in 2008, reaching 4.29 billion euros.",
  "Over the entire period, imports fell by 85.9 percent.",
  "These values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, which may affect the interpretation of the trend."
